{
  "file" : "npc/re/instances/LostFarm.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 14,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- You cannot proceed with the quest because you have too many items. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 18,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Cotton]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 19,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Well, you look to weak to work. I don't think you can do it right now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- This quest is for level 150 or higher -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- I've met eyes with the automatic doll in front of the farming facility. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- The doll looked at me up and down, and turn its head. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- I've met eyes with the automatic doll in front of the farming facility. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Automatic Doll]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Heart rate, blood pressure, and body temperature is all normal."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Breathing is normal. Eyes stability normal."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Checking registration information..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- The doll looked at me up and down, and as if she look satisfied. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Automatic Doll]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "Hello, {0}?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Did you come to see farming facility?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Huh."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Automatic Doll]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "This is the farming facility, where Kitty and the others live."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Just talk to me, if you're interested."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I will explain everything to you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Automatic Doll]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Kitty, hold still for a minute. Good boy~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I am in charge of the farm facility here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I fix the plants, give it fertilizer and feed kitty here and his friends."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Automatic Doll]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "The ingredients for the dessert that comes out from the cafeteria is harvested here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Ehem."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Automatic Doll]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "There have been a lot of guests lately, so we've been given more orders to harvest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "My colleague from an another job has just been assigned to this place, but she's a little clumsy."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "It's easy to get a good harvest when everyone listens."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "You're talkative."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Oh, I forgot that I should introduce myself first, if I wanted to talk to a guest for a long time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "My name is Luina."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Kitty here is a plant called a Pitaya. It's an improved ancient species that lived somewhere on this island."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I don't know if it's weird, but I'm not a Pitaya, but I'm good at listening."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- Luina stroked the Pitaya. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "My master told me, I should name cute little things."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Kitty, Butterfly, Happy, and so on."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Pitaya is a small and cute creature, so I gave them a name."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Kitty is the cutest, the pitaya over here is Kitty."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "So..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Are you here to cut off some tails?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Tail?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I don't have a tail."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "You're here to cut off some tails, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Oh, I've made a mistake."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Hold on for a while. I'll process the explanation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "If you look at Kitty right now, He doesn't have roots, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "It absorbs moisture from the air and photosyntheses it even without the roots."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Just some fertilizer... and some foods."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "When you plant the seeds, they grow out of the ground, but I've never seen a multiple sprout before."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "For the tail, You just grab the Pitaya, stroke it like this, and let them go."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- Luina held the Pitaya, demo to on how to pull the tail and put it down. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "No, no. I didn't pull it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "The harvested tail is not necessarily enough to eat."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "You have to take the loss into account."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "You need to remove the seeds and the skin, but it's not difficult."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "After processing it, the harvested Pitaya tail goes up to the table."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Harvesting is actually a bit difficult, so my colleague, 'Silk', will guide you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "You can enter even without a harvest. I'll just let you in here without a guide."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "If you're free, talk to 'Cotton' here, she's the play manager, and she'll let you know what to do."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I know it's a little hard for you, but... if you lend us a hand, we will properly compensate you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Now that you've heard the instructions, you can enter now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "You can just go in if you want to look around."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "We talked about Cotton's job first, but it's actually the harvest that's more urgent."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "If you're confident in your combat skills, I'd like you to help with the harvest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I wish you can help me with the harvest..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "We have to feed Boss Kitty also."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Boss Kitty?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I just call him that, He is a little different from the other, it's hiding in a place that's hard to see."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "If you want to see him around, you'll have to sprink the food and make it a little noisy around the farm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I'm the one in charge of the harvest, so please talk to me anytime you want!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Let's talk about the details when you want to help."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Did the younglings came to play with you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "That's strange... I heard you very well."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "... what? Even Silk?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "What happened?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "She is pretending to be a cat."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Kitty]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Cluck."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "-- The cat hid behind Luina before she reached it. --"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "What..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Maybe... just maybe?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "It's listening to me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I guess."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Kitty."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Is this what the guests would say as 'embarassed'?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- When Luina reached out her hand to the cat, it put it's heads up to her hand. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- Luina's face became complex with a satisfied expression while petting the cat. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Won't the guest will be able to befriend meow someday?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Wouldn't it be great if we continued playing with them like this?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Yes! Please help Silk again tomorrow as well."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Then, one day... You'll be able to befriend all of the Pitayas!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Here... it's a token of promise."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Probably."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "- The cat cried with a high pitch sound as if it's excited. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "We have completed the necessary harvest for today."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "We will resume our harvest again by dawn. Come back by then."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "^0000FFOur struggle with the Pitaya seems like a long time ago.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "^0000FFI now have the courage again to go back into the farming facility again.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "^FF0000You must organize for atleast one person or join a party to enter.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "!? What happened? You have a broken tail."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "I'll take care of that, please."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Thank you.... After the next harvest experience, be sure to deliver it to Silk and come out."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 250,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "[Luina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "Hello, {0}."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Are you going to enter the farming facility today?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Luina",
      "text" : "Enter the dungeon."
    },
